<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><a href="/jbhl">HOME</a> / HOME LOAN OPTIONS</p><h1>Bring your debts into focus before making a move.</h1><p class="hero-lead">If you own property, consolidating debts into a home loan may change your repayments. Understand the total cost and security risk first.</p><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Talk through your options <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="page-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Australian home in a landscaped garden"></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT TO CONSIDER</p><h2>Property backed debt consolidation: start with your situation.</h2><p>There is no single loan structure that suits everyone. We will talk through what you want to achieve, how a loan could fit your budget and what you should understand before applying.</p></div><div class="detail-rows"><div class="detail-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Map the current debts</h3><p>We look at balances, rates, repayments and the remaining term of each debt alongside your home loan.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Test the overall cost</h3><p>A lower monthly repayment can still mean paying more over a longer period. We compare fees, loan terms and total interest.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Understand the property risk</h3><p>Moving unsecured debts into a loan secured by your home can put your property at risk if you cannot keep up repayments.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-section section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>A few things worth knowing.</h2></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Will consolidating debts reduce what I owe?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>It combines debts into a different loan arrangement; it does not itself reduce the principal you owe. Fees and a longer term may increase the total cost.</p></details><details><summary>What if I am already struggling with repayments?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Tell us early. We can discuss your circumstances and available pathways, including support outside property backed lending.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
</div>
